# Critical Review Report — `theory/Topics/simulation_model/`

Files audited (excluding `index.qmd` and `Effective_ham.qmd`): TFIM.qmd, ferm_Hubbard.qmd, Boson-Hubbard.qmd, honeycomb.qmd, puccd.qmd, dynamics.qmd, density_wave.qmd, LGT.qmd, topological.qmd, XY_XXZ.qmd, optimization.qmd

