## === puccd.qmd ===
PASS: Q3, Q6, Q8, Q9, Q11, Q12
FAIL:
- **Q1**: The intro (line 14–19) is two question callouts, not a 2–3 sentence summary stating which model, which Rydberg mechanism, and why it matters. The actual summary content appears implicitly through the body text, but there is no explicit intro paragraph at the top. Line 14 is a "Question" callout, line 21 is a "Discussion" callout. The first substantive text is "In quantum chemistry, we care about the Hamiltonian..." (line 24).
